# Source-only build context for the image build (Dockerfile at the repo root).
**
!README.md
!apps/
!apps/**
!packages/
!packages/**
!modules/
!modules/**
!connectors/
!connectors/**
!channels/
!channels/**
!runtimes/
!runtimes/**
!packs/
!packs/**
!deploy/
!deploy/**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version

# Re-exclude private artifacts and local dependencies within allowed source trees.
**/AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.override.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/.codex/**
**/.claude/**
**/.mcp.json
**/.rheo-local/**
**/.secrets/**
**/rheo.local.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.log
**/.bureau/**
**/.bureau-worktrees/**
**/node_modules/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.git/**

# Re-exclude generated web build output re-included by the !apps/** allowlist
# above (last match wins): apps/web/.next is ~57MB of generated Next output and
# has no place in the image build context.
**/.next/**
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
